---
title: >-
  The Chittagong-Sylhet Axis: How Internal Logistics Dictate BD Tech Growth.
publishedAt: '2026-04-15'
pillar: geopolitics
summary: >-
  Why physical infrastructure is still the ultimate gatekeeper for digital-first
  agencies in Bangladesh.
---
Physical infrastructure dictates digital capacity. While most digital agencies in Dhaka focus on software and abstraction, the reality of hardware procurement, transit corridors, and power grid resilience between major internal hubs fundamentally caps or accelerates our actual growth.

This note explores the friction points within internal BD logistics and why ignoring physical reality leads to failed digital scale.
